# Copy to apps/mobile/.env. Expo reads it from this directory on
# `expo start` and `expo export`, and inlines every EXPO_PUBLIC_* value
# into the bundle at build time — so these are public by design, and a
# change needs a rebuild (web) or a new EAS update (Android).

# API the app talks to. Unset → app.json `extra.apiBaseUrl`, then
# http://localhost:8787.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8787

# Owner location console map (T4.10, TON.8) — a MapLibre style URL.
# Decided 2026-09-15: hosted OpenStreetMap tiles from MapTiler. Unset →
# the console shows the roster with a "map not configured" panel.
# Restrict the key to the web app's origins in the MapTiler dashboard;
# a key in a browser bundle is readable by anyone who opens the page.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_MAP_STYLE_URL=https://api.maptiler.com/maps/streets-v2/style.json?key=YOUR_MAPTILER_KEY
